  "description": "Cantina 7 with it's all new Pedal-Forward frame design maintains all the simplicity of the Cantina, but it's not all paddleboards and Pina Coladas, you're also packing Shimano 7-speed twist shifters and a powerful linear pull brakeset for those days when you need to turn mountains into molehills. Add to that an oversized Del Sol cruiser springer saddle and swept back cruiser handlebars and you have all the comforts of home on two wheels.\nHi-ten steel SuperCruise Pedal-Forward frame featuring longer, more laid-back geometry for the perfect cruise\nShimano Tourney 7-speed drivetrain with Revo twist shifter\n3 piece alloy crankset\nCustom Del Sol Cruiser bars for the most comfortable hand position\nNew Del Sol elastomer-sprung cruiser saddle\nLightweight & rust-free alloy rims\nSmooth-riding 26\" x 2.125\" cruiser tires",
